Most of these aren't that essential.  AC -28 is already great, so while
protection and a shirt might be nice, neither is necessary.  The cursed
potions and scrolls are convenience only, and the Orb lets you level teleport.
Though you do want teleport control for that.  You're tough enough to not need
a pet, which obviates the magic whistle.  Magic markers are nice, but again,
not essential.

You do need more hitpoints eventually, but as people said, you find stuff in
Gehennom, so hopefully you'll cope.  Also, with the Orb, maybe you don't need
hitpoints that badly.

Your power looks way too low, though.  Oh wait, you're a dwarf, maybe you
don't get power all the time.

Mojo and a saber are a nice combination for now, but you might want to pick up
a long sword for later.

Dexterity could be higher.

But frankly, you look nearly Ascension ready as is.  The one thing you
"forgot" is a ring of free action, but you may find one down in Gehennom.
Otherwise you're a buff, tough, Valkyrie.

